11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Run (referred to on-screen as Run.) is a 2020 American psychological horror thriller
film directed by Aneesh Chaganty, and written by Chaganty and Sev Ohanian.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film stars Kiera Allen as disabled teenager Chloe Sherman, who begins to suspect that her
mother, Diane (Sarah Paulson), has been keeping a dark secret about her upbringing.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film has connections to other films by Chaganty and Ohanian and is the
second installment in the filmmaking duo's Searching film series.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Run was released in the United States via streaming on November 20, 2020, on Hulu, and was released in other
territories both theatrically and through streaming by Lionsgate International and by Netflix on April 2, 2021.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film received generally positive reviews from critics and became
Hulu's most successful original film upon its release.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film explores themes of small town, wheelchair user   ,
homeschooling, single mother, washington state.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The tone is dark and emotional and intense.
